c kettle\n• Air fryer\n\nLiving, working & technology\n• High-quality beds with excellent sleeping comfort\n• Generous wardrobe space and well-designed storage solutions\n• Flat-screen TV\n• Dedicated workspace with desk and height-adjustable office chair\n\nAdditional comfort\n• Ironing board and iron\n• Washing machine in the shared basement\n• Optional private basement storage room\n• Bicycle garage in the building\n\nLocation\n\nThe apartment benefits from a central yet green setting:\n\n• Supermarkets, bakeries, doctors, cafés and post office within walking distance\n• Bus stop directly in front of the building\n• Quick access to S-Bahn lines S6 & S11 (Cologne & Düsseldorf)\n• Excellent motorway connections to A59, A46 and A3\n• Nature reserve “Kämpe” approx. 5 minutes walking distance\n\nWell connected — surrounded by nature.\n\nIdeal for business professionals, project-based employees, commuters or expats with a temporary stay.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"72"},"tv":{"value":